# Black key auditions normally in PERFORMANCE.
100 keys 2
150 keys 0

# Enter SEQ. Designated black key selects a track; white key selects a step;
# reserved black key is consumed. None may audition or emit MIDI here.
200 btn 11
250 keys 2
300 keys 0
350 keys 1
400 keys 0
450 keys 1048576
500 keys 0

# Return HOME, start the same black performance note, then enter SEQ while held.
# Release must still terminate the manual note after the context change.
550 btn 8
600 keys 2
650 btn 11
700 keys 0
800 end
